'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[cape]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
Issued by the [[Ministry of Prosperity]] on January 1st, 2026 to players who logged in between December 18, 2025 and December 31, 2025.<ref>Discord conversation with AH Support regarding exclusive item eligibility brackets | [https://discord.com/channels/1210060956584124416/1210073264928456764/1496914142777311253 Discord link] | [[:File:Primary_Source_Discord_conversation_with_BVits_regarding_exclusive_item_eligibility_brackets.png|File]]</ref>

== Lore ==
Issued to all Helldivers who participated in [[Major Orders#A2-12-4|2185's]] [[Festival of Reckoning]] by High Command.

== Trivia ==
* The cape’s design appears to be based on the emblem of the Terran Empire from ''Star Trek''.

